    "source": "gpu-jax-g5g-2b",
    "notes": "First context x output-length sweep on this rig; earlier runs were a single point. Concurrency is fixed at 1 because the hardware allows nothing else: MAX_NUM_SEQS=1, Gemma4EModelJAX raises NotImplementedError for B>1, and the decode step donates its KV buffers. Every cell is warmed AT THE SHAPE IT MEASURES, because max_new_tokens is a static_argnames entry and warming at a different value leaves the measured request cold (previously a 4x error). Instance was spot and was terminated after the run."
  },
